"A seed of the Crimson Blight falls into Kastilla's ocean and spreads through its sea life."
"The Kastillans forge a living sword holding their king's soul as bait to trap the blight's core."
"A mining foreman and his crew free the core, and the blight overruns the whole planet."
"Meddlers from another planet later purge every trace of the blight from the surface."
